1932+ 78AA 38 22            jr   c, .collision
1933+ 78AC
1934+ 78AC                  ; Punto 4: Mid-Right (X + 7, Y + 7)
1935+ 78AC 79               ld   a, c
1936+ 78AD C6 07            add  a, 7
1937+ 78AF 4F               ld   c, a
1938+ 78B0 CD 63 78         call CheckNastyCell
1939+ 78B3 38 19            jr   c, .collision
1940+ 78B5
1941+ 78B5                  ; Punto 5: Bottom-Left (X, Y + 15)
1942+ 78B5 ED 4B 57 EB      ld   bc, (PlayerPos)
1943+ 78B9 78               ld   a, b
1944+ 78BA C6 0F            add  a, 15
1945+ 78BC 47               ld   b, a
1946+ 78BD CD 63 78         call CheckNastyCell
1947+ 78C0 38 0C            jr   c, .collision
1948+ 78C2
1949+ 78C2                  ; Punto 6: Bottom-Right (X + 7, Y + 15)
1950+ 78C2 79               ld   a, c
1951+ 78C3 C6 07            add  a, 7
1952+ 78C5 4F               ld   c, a
1953+ 78C6 CD 63 78         call CheckNastyCell
