1882+ 85BE CD 59 85         call CheckWillyItemCollision
1883+ 85C1
1884+ 85C1 E1               pop  hl
1885+ 85C2
1886+ 85C2                  ; Nessuna collisione
1887+ 85C2 30 3B            jr   nc, .next_no_inc
