1987+ 85FB                  ; ---------------------------------------------------------------
1988+ 85FB 23               inc  hl
1989+ 85FC 23               inc  hl
1990+ 85FD 23               inc  hl
1991+ 85FE 23               inc  hl
1992+ 85FF
1993+ 85FF              .next_no_inc:
1994+ 85FF
1995+ 85FF                  ; ---------------------------------------------------------------
1996+ 85FF                  ; Avanza al record successivo.
